	<meta name="description" content="The Trauma Nursing column is produced in partnership with the Board of Certification for Emergency Nursing (BCEN®), developer of the Trauma Certified Registered Nurse (TCRN®) certification.Inhalation injuries occur when respiratory tissue is damaged by heat, smoke or chemicals. More than three-quarters (77%) of burn victim deaths are due to pulmonary complications from inhalation injuries. Trauma" />
